              <div class="tier-item"><strong>Standard ($15K):</strong> Category findings + platform perception profile + competitive comparison</div>
              <div class="tier-item"><strong>Premium ($25K):</strong> + buyer segmentation, switching analysis, curated verbatim evidence</div>
